      "functional_impact_measured": "Surface display confirmed by non-permeabilized anti-S-protein immunocytochemistry in CHO cells (L7) and by luminal-surface antibody binding in perfused mouse hearts (L4) and immunofluorescence confocal microscopy of capillary cross-sections (L5). LPL-binding function of the S-tagged construct is NOT MEASURED explicitly in the provided clips (though the comparison construct GPIHBP1-W109S is noted as LPL-binding-deficient, implying WT S-GPIHBP1 retains binding).",
